# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Samriddhi Gyan LMS — Workspace Environment Guide
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
#  This workspace consists of multiple distinct sub-services:
#   1. client/                      (Vite / React Frontend)
#   2. server/                      (Node.js / Express Core Backend)
#   3. hybrid_recommendation_server/ (FastAPI / Python AI Engine)
#
#  To configure each environment:
#   - Copy client/.env.example to client/.env
#   - Copy server/.env.example to server/.env
#   - Copy hybrid_recommendation_server/.env.example to hybrid_recommendation_server/.env
#
#  CRITICAL SECURITY RULES:
#   - NEVER commit any .env file to Git.
#   - NEVER prefix private secrets with VITE_, REACT_APP_, or NEXT_PUBLIC_.
#   - Rotate any previously hardcoded keys immediately before deployment.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
